": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"874919b08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/issues/sig-security-164.md\", \"id\": \"e62fb3818dcae1f1\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.36343378894112843, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.21120251277304064, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7186401, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/issues/sig-security-164.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"874919b08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/issues/sig-security-164.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/issues/sig-security-164.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 6168, \"chunk_count\": 5, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:19\", \"token_count\": 2203, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"  - Meeting notes: [Ecosystem Explorer Project](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1QBpFmSR54fGus8q6RraUj0-mEjSoX7S7fdlgsvxZsuk/edit?usp=sharing)  \\n\\n  - [https://github.com/mikeblum/otel-explorer-go-docs/blob/3797539be4f5a760e99586c0de72496019f5e6b0/instrumentation-list.yaml](https://github.com/mikeblum/otel-explorer-go-docs/blob/3797539be4f5a760e99586c0de72496019f5e6b0/instrumentation-list.yaml)  \\n\\n### SIG Security: release signing\\n\\n- Robert proposed enabling GitHub “signature releases” in addition to existing tag signing and GPG signatures of source archives.\\n\\n- Key points:\\n\\n  - GitHub’s source tarball/zip is generated at download time; signing artifacts strengthens trust and mitigates changes over time.\\n\\n  - Double-signing is acceptable and beneficial for OSS Scorecard/compliance.\\n\\n  - Constraint: Artifacts must be uploaded at release time; cannot regenerate later.\\n\\n- Decision: Proceed with enabling signature releases; update release documentation and ensure process discipline.\\n\\nReferences:\\n\\n- [https://github.com/open-telemetry/sig-security/issues/164](https://github.com/open-telemetry/sig-security/issues/164)  \\n\\n### KubeCon updates\\n\\n- OpenTelemetry Observatory booth confirmed.\\n\\n- Go SIG will meet at the booth (Tuesday morning, local time; check published schedule).\\n\\n- Plan to cancel the Zoom SIG meeting during KubeCon week; reminder will be sent next week.\\n\\n- Community encouraged to stop by the booth and participate.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-06]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-11-03\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3479655348  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-11-03T09:39:04Z · **Updated**: 2025-11-03T09:40:01Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-10-30\\n\\n**Attendees:**\\n\\n- Tyler Yahn\\n\\n- Bryan Boreham\\n\\n- Damien Mathieu\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"meet note ecosystem explor project http doc googl com document d 1qbpfmsr54fgus8q6rrauj0 mejsox7s7fdlgsvxzsuk edit usp share http github com mikeblum otel explor go doc blob 3797539be4f5a760e99586c0de72496019f5e6b0 instrument list yaml http github com mikeblum otel explor go doc blob 3797539be4f5a760e99586c0de72496019f5e6b0 instrument list yaml sig secur releas sign robert propos enabl github signatur releas in addit to exist tag sign and gpg signatur of sourc archiv key point github s sourc tarbal zip is generat at download time sign artifact strengthen trust and mitig chang over time doubl sign is accept and benefici for os scorecard complianc constraint artifact must be upload at releas time can not regener later decis proceed with enabl signatur releas updat releas document and ensur process disciplin refer http github com open telemetri sig secur issu 164 http github com open telemetri sig secur issu 164 kubecon updat opentelemetri observatori booth confirm go sig will meet at the booth tuesday morn local time check publish schedul plan to cancel the zoom sig meet dure kubecon week remind will be sent next week communiti encourag to stop by the booth and particip sourc id src note 06 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2025 11 03 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3479655348 author pellar creat 2025 11 03t09 39 04z updat 2025 11 03t09 40 01z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 10 30 attende tyler yahn bryan boreham damien mathieu\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"874039c68a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479655348.md\", \"id\": \"0032f870da180d9a\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.34796206259161877, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.1920156394165983, \"vector_similarity\": 0.71183705, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479655348.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"874039c68a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479655348.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479655348.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 7597, \"chunk_count\": 4, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:24\", \"token_count\": 1926, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"I don’t think this is the expected result; in any case—whether it’s middleware or something else—it should be able to retrieve the file again.\\n\\nI think we may need to investigate this issue further.\\n\\n**flc1125** on `instrumentation/github.com/gin-gonic/gin/otelgin/gin_test.go` (line 512) — 2025-11-11T13:59:33Z\\n\\nBased on this PR, I’ve provided a prototype reference: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-c