open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib pull 8161 dmathieu akats7 take a look and see how it work if we adjust it accord to the prototyp akats7 on instrument github com gin gonic gin otelgin gin _ test go line 512 2025 11 11t15 42 57z flc1125 can you clarifi which behavior you re refer to a incorrect are you refer to requir errori t err f errnotexist yile j on instrument github com gin gonic gin otelgin gin _ test go line 512 2025 11 12t01 28 14z i thought we had alreadi agre on the removeal approach natur if you call removeal the temporari file are delet and can t be access afterward sinc this happen dure the middlewar s return phase i d expect that most middlewar wouldn t read the multipart form at that point anyway i m not sure if the implic of removeal were discuss in the sig meet but it might be worth confirm akats7 on instrument github com gin gonic gin otelgin gin _ test go line 512 2025 11 12t10 24 52z flc1125 i m still not clear on the result you re refer to the result align to my understand of what we ve discuss also i m not sure if your prototyp fix would work i think it still doesn t address the core issu which is that when we origin set c request c request withcontext ctx with an unpars form the http server won t know to clean it up i don t think clone the request solv that sourc id src pr 01 pull request fix otelgin remov multipartform temporari file open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib 6609\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8755686e8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-6609.md\", \"id\": \"ee5caba072c6dc26\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2873647687289475, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.10542611246992503, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7118883, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-6609.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8755686e8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-6609.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/pulls/opentelemetry-go-contrib-6609.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 27213, \"chunk_count\": 18, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:09\", \"token_count\": 9176, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"*   David also mentioned ongoing work on exponential histograms and a simpler \\\"last value\\\" PR that shares code with the histogram one.\\n\\n*   Tyler expressed a strong desire to merge the histogram reservoir PR in the current milestone due to its significant performance improvement and encouraged attendees to review it.\\n\\n**6. Milestone Check-in and Release Goals**\\n\\n*   Tyler conducted a check-in on the v1.39.0 milestones for [Otel](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/milestone/74) and [Contrib](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/milestone/33).\\n\\n*   **Exposed Temporality Selector Function PR:** Tyler noted that a previous SIG meeting concluded this PR was API pollution and should be closed. He will draft a comment and close it today.\\n\\n*   **Simple Span Processor (Tracing):** This PR needs another round of reviews but is considered straightforward and should remain in the milestone.\\n\\n*   **OTLP Metric GRPC Exporter Metrics:** This PR has been open for a while and needs more iteration. It might be moved out of the current milestone if a release push occurs.\\n\\n*   **Metrics SDK Standard Out Metrics Exporter & Standard Log Exporter:** Both PRs lack follow-up from their original authors and significant work is still needed. They are candidates for being bumped from the milestone.\\n\\n*   **Overall Release Strategy:** Tyler proposed making a release before KubeCon (less than a month away) and urged everyone to prioritize reviews for the critical PRs to achieve this goal.\\n\\n**7. KubeCon Discussion**\\n\\n*   **David Ashpole** asked if there was anything specific to announce or discuss at KubeCon.\\n\\n*   **Robert Pająk** mentioned the extended attributes merge in specification and product as something he'd like to highlight, though it's not ready.\\n\\n*   **Tyler Yahn** expressed interest in showcasing the new observability features.\\n\\n*   David suggested working towards a stable release of the HTTP instrumentation in Contrib. Tyler agreed it was a good idea but noted the significant work involved due to existing \\\"cruft\\\" and potential needs for API restructuring.\\n\\n**8. Tyler's Side Project (OTLP Exporter Error Types)**\\n\\n*   Tyler shared that he's been working on introducing new, custom error types for OTLP exporters to provide clearer, more unified error messages. This involves distinguishing between HTTP/gRPC errors, partial errors, and warnings. He has a prototype integrated for Otel Trace gRPC. While not critical, it improves observability and user understanding of errors.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"david also mention ongo work on exponenti histogram and a simpler last valu pr that share code with the histogram one tyler express a strong desir to merg the histogram reservoir pr in the current mileston due to it signific perform improv and encourag attende to review it 6 mileston check in and releas goal tyler conduct a check in on the v1 39 0 mileston for otel http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go mileston 74 and contrib http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib mileston 33 expos tempor selector function pr tyler note that a previous sig meet conclud this pr wa api pollut and should be close he will draft a comment and close it today simpl span processor trace this pr need anoth round of review but is consid straightforward and should remain in the mileston otlp metric grpc export metric this pr ha been open for a while and need more iter it might be move out of the current mileston if a releas push occur metric sdk standard out metric export standard log export both pr lack follow up from their origin author and signific work is still need they are candid for be bump from the mileston overal releas strategi tyler propos make a releas befor kubecon less than a month away and urg everyon to priorit review for the critic pr to achiev this goal 7 kubecon discuss david ashpol ask if there wa anyth specif to announc or discus at kubecon robert paj ą k mention the extend attribut merg in specif and product a someth he d like to highlight though it s not readi tyler yahn express interest in showcas the new observ featur david suggest work toward a stabl releas of the http instrument in contrib tyler agre it wa a good idea but note the signific work involv due to exist cruft and potenti need for api restructur 8 tyler s side project otlp export error type tyler share that he s been work on introduc new custom error type for otlp export to provid clearer more unifi error messag this involv distinguish between http grpc error partial error and warn he ha a prototyp integr for otel trace grpc while not critic it improv observ and user understand of error\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"873e60b08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479584781.md\", \"id\": \"fc13fa8c97d8e3a2\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2788063387289475, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.10542611246992503, \"vector_similarity\": 0.6833602, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479584781.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"873e60b08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479584781.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479584781.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 8756, \"chunk_count\": 4, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:25\", \"token_count\": 2164, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Two non-observability items noted:\\n\\n  - Sync map / atomics for fixed bucket histograms.\\n\\n  - Exemplar reservoir changes.\\n\\n- Safe to slip to next release; include if ready.\\n\\n### 4. Stabilizing new attribute value types\\n\\n- Discussion about stabilizing new spec attribute types (byte arrays, “any” type).\\n\\n- Prototype implementation exists and needs review.\\n\\n- Considered tricky; careful review needed around limits and types.\\n\\n### 5. Processor `Enabled` method\\n\\n- Proposal from Robert to move `Enabled` from filter processor to main processor interface.\\n\\n- Spec now stabilized and allows this.\\n\\n- Pros: consistent API, less ad-hoc type assertion/boilerplate in docs.\\n\\n- Con: processors that are “always enabled” need a trivial `Enabled() bool { return true }`.\\n\\n- General agreement; will revisit for final confirmation.\\n\\n### 6. OTLP `insecure` support (logs, env vars, spec)\\n\\n- PR adds `insecure` (env var) support for OTLP **logs**, matching traces/metrics.\\n\\n- HTTP OTLP config historically messy; env vars common in practice.\\n\\n- Spec unclear due to moratorium on env vars.\\n\\n- Direction: add logs support in Go; push for spec clarity later.\\n\\n### 7. Collector protobuf changes & PDataGen\\n\\n- Collector removed dependency on Go protobuf types; now uses `pdataGen`.\\n\\n- Large internal rewrite; significant line count reduction.\\n\\n- Benchmarks improved (fewer allocations).\\n\\n- Some cross-language quirks surfaced but manageable.\\n\\n- Go SIG interested in exploring similar approaches; needs more benchmarking.\\n\\n### 8. KubeCon & talks\\n\\n- First SIG meeting since KubeCon.\\n\\n- Members encouraged to share notable talks and videos once available.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-07]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-11-26\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3581463689  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-11-26T14:02:28Z · **Updated**: 2025-11-26T16:36:01Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-20  \\n\\n## Decisions\\n\\n- Merge OTelConf RC support PR as-is (pending normal review).\\n\\n- Track experimental API structure review (e.g., `x` submodule) under the `1.40.0` milestone.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"two non observ item note sync map atom for fix bucket histogram exemplar reservoir chang safe to slip to next releas includ if readi 4 stabil new attribut valu type discuss about stabil new spec attribut type byte array ani type prototyp implement exist and need review consid tricki care review need around limit and type 5 processor enabl method propos from robert to move enabl from filter processor to main processor interfac spec now stabil and allow this pro consist api less ad hoc type assert boilerpl in doc con processor that are alway enabl need a trivial enabl bool return true general agreement will revisit for final confirm 6 otlp insecur support log env var spec pr add insecur env var support for otlp log match trace metric http otlp config histor messi env var common in practic spec unclear due to moratorium on env var direct add log support in go push for spec clariti later 7 collector protobuf chang pdatagen collector remov depend on go protobuf type now us pdatagen larg intern rewrit signific line count reduct benchmark improv fewer alloc some cross languag quirk surfac but manag go sig interest in explor similar approach need more benchmark 8 kubecon talk first sig meet sinc kubecon member encourag to share notabl talk and video onc avail sourc id src note 07 meet