_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"874919b08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/issues/sig-security-164.md\", \"id\": \"e62fb3818dcae1f1\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3199542564599731, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.1324320806571044, \"vector_similarity\": 0.757506, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/issues/sig-security-164.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"874919b08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/issues/sig-security-164.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/issues/sig-security-164.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 6168, \"chunk_count\": 5, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:19\", \"token_count\": 2203, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-03]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-10-10\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3390010099  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-10T13:10:44Z · **Updated**: 2025-10-10T14:04:27Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-10-09\\n\\n**Attendees:**\\n\\n- Tyler Yahn\\n\\n- David Ashpole\\n\\n- Bryan Boreham\\n\\n## Agenda Items\\n\\n### 1. Milestone Progress Review\\n\\n**Current milestone status:**\\n\\n- 17 items still open in the milestone\\n\\n- Most PRs are in review phase or awaiting final approvals\\n\\n**Key items discussed:**\\n\\n#### Expose temporality selector functions\\n\\n- **Status:** Under discussion, may not be accepted in current form\\n\\n- **Discussion:** Tyler and David discussed whether to expose temporality selector parsing functions for configuration\\n\\n- **Decision:** Not recommended for inclusion in SDK. Users should use full OpenTelemetry configuration file format instead of custom configuration snippets\\n\\n- **Rationale:** Want to standardize on OTel configuration format rather than supporting fragmented approaches\\n\\n- **Action:** Tyler to respond with feedback about standardization preference\\n\\n#### Prometheus Exporter Migration\\n\\n- **Status:** Implementation complete, needs deprecation decision\\n\\n- **Discussion:** Need to decide on deprecating existing configuration options\\n\\n- **Decision:** Tyler supports deprecation before marking as stable\\n\\n- **Next steps:** Handle in next milestone\\n\\n#### Error Handling for Prometheus\\n\\n- **Status:** PR ready for review, waiting for conversation resolution\\n\\n- **Action:** David to review and potentially merge\\n\\n#### High mutex contention in metric sums\\n\\n- **Status:** Resolved via PR #7427\\n\\n- **Action:** Close issue\\n\\n### 2. Optimization Work Discussion\\n\\n**David's current work:**\\n\\n- Implementing lockless exponential histogram\\n\\n- Fun and challenging optimization project\\n\\n- Building on previous optimization PRs\\n\\n**PR Reviews needed:**\\n\\n- **PR #7474:** Exemplar reservoir optimization (approved by Tyler, needs second approval)\\n\\n- **PR #7443:** Histogram optimization (needs review, has race condition issue identified)\\n\\n**Technical discussion on PR #7443:**\\n\\n- Tyler identified potential race condition in min/max tracking with `isSet` flag\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src note 03 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2025 1010 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3390010099 author pellar creat 2025 10 10t13 10 44z updat 2025 10 10t14 04 27z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 10 09 attende tyler yahn david ashpol bryan boreham agenda item 1 mileston progress review current mileston status 17 item still open in the mileston most pr are in review phase or await final approv key item discuss expos tempor selector function status under discuss may not be accept in current form discuss tyler and david discuss whether to expos tempor selector pars function for configur decis not recommend for inclus in sdk user should use full opentelemetri configur file format instead of custom configur snippet rational want to standard on otel configur format rather than support fragment approach action tyler to respond with feedback about standard prefer prometheus export migrat status implement complet need deprec decis discuss need to decid on deprec exist configur option decis tyler support deprec befor mark a stabl next step handl in next mileston error handl for prometheus status pr readi for review wait for convers resolut action david to review and potenti merg high mutex content in metric sum status resolv via pr 7427 action close issu 2 optim work discuss david s current work implement lockless exponenti histogram fun and challeng optim project build on previous optim pr pr review need pr 7474 exemplar reservoir optim approv by tyler need second approv pr 7443 histogram optim need review ha race condit issu identifi technic discuss on pr 7443 tyler identifi potenti race condit in min max track with isset flag\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"87365f6e8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3390010099.md\", \"id\": \"22374080d99b56a3\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.28470878003192085, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.10310750004560121, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7084451, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3390010099.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"87365f6e8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3390010099.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3390010099.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 3423, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:31\", \"token_count\": 796, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Robert Pająk\\n\\n- David Ashpole\\n\\n- Mike Blum\\n\\n## Action Items\\n\\n- Robert:\\n\\n  - Work with GC to set up a maintainers mailing list for OSS-Fuzz notifications and ensure appropriate access for Go SIG maintainers.\\n\\n  - Consider manual recreation of older OSS-Fuzz issues if needed; revisit auto GitHub issue filing after triage process matures.\\n\\n  - Take ownership of otelhttp issue [#7254](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/7254); draft a document clarifying error marking approach and semconv alignment.\\n\\n  - Enable GitHub signature releases for OTel Go; update releasing docs; ensure artifacts are uploaded at release time and signatures published. Reference: [sig-security #164](https://github.com/open-telemetry/sig-security/issues/164).\\n\\n- Damien:\\n\\n  - Open an issue to kick off an audit of the otelhttp API for stabilization and coordinate reviews.\\n\\n- David (dashpole):\\n\\n  - Monitor semconv RPC stabilization efforts; once stable, drive otelgrpc module stabilization.\\n\\n  - Sync with Josh regarding gRPC team engagement; explore KubeCon conversations if feasible.\\n\\n- Mike:\\n\\n  - Iterate on the otel Explorer Go docs schema:\\n\\n    - Align with OTEL semantic conventions.\\n\\n    - Ensure Weaver compatibility.\\n\\n    - Provide a JSON Schema (or CUE) for validation.\\n\\n    - Consider linking instrumentations to existing semconv references.\\n\\n- Tyler:\\n\\n  - Assign relevant GitHub tasks/issues from this meeting.\\n\\n  - Confirm KubeCon schedule and cancel the Zoom SIG meeting during KubeCon week; share booth details with the community.\\n\", \"content_ltks\