emetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8078.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-8078.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 4910, \"chunk_count\": 3, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:12\", \"token_count\": 1517, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"  - Status: PR exists; default temporality aggregation functions were not exposed; proposal includes a string-based “temporality select.”\\n\\n  - Concern: Replacing functions via string selector raised concerns.\\n\\n  - Next: No recent activity; likely to wait and potentially move out of the milestone.\\n\\n- Optimized locking for metric aggregation:\\n\\n  - Status: Work in progress by David; awaiting one more testing PR before starting locking improvements.\\n\\n  - Context: Approach reviewed informally with Josh McDonald; thought reasonably good.\\n\\n  - Testing PR: “Add concurrent-safe tests for metric aggregation” needs more reviews.\\n\\n  - Notes: A test-run issue caused confusion around time ordering; not a fundamental `time.Now` issue. Go 1.25 testing time manipulation may help if needed.\\n\\n- Exporter: Prometheus migrate to new configuration options:\\n\\n  - Status: On David’s list.\\n\\n  - Scope: Expected to be a one-line default change; no “Help Wanted” needed.\\n\\n- Improved error handling:\\n\\n  - Status: PR was in draft and author became inactive.\\n\\n  - Decision: Remove from milestone; consider pinging the author. Should not block release.\\n\\n- High mutex contention in metric sums:\\n\\n  - Status: Assigned to David; actively being fixed.\\n\\n- Observability packages:\\n\\n  - Status: Multiple PRs open and being reworked.\\n\\n  - Release impact: Not critical for upcoming release; if they block, move them out.\\n\\n  - Activity: Some PRs show movement; Tyler is actively working on one; others have limited updates.\\n\\n- Prometheus exporter: Optimize return times:\\n\\n  - Status: Worth review for those working on observability metrics.\\n\\n  - Context: Already merged for the standard trace exporter.\\n\\n  - Note: Awaiting minimum time requirement (~23 minutes) before completion.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-01]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-10-10\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3389930076  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-10T12:53:12Z · **Updated**: 2025-10-10T12:54:14Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-09-25\\n\\n**Attendees:**\\n\\n- Tyler Yahn.\\n\\n- Bryan Boreham.\\n\\n- David Ashpole (dashpole).\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"status pr exist default tempor aggreg function were not expos propos includ a string base tempor select concern replac function via string selector rais concern next no recent activ like to wait and potenti move out of the mileston optim lock for metric aggreg status work in progress by david await one more test pr befor start lock improv context approach review inform with josh mcdonald thought reason good test pr add concurr safe test for metric aggreg need more review note a test run issu caus confus around time order not a fundament time now issu go 1 25 test time manipul may help if need export prometheus migrat to new configur option status on david s list scope expect to be a one line default chang no help want need improv error handl status pr wa in draft and author becam inact decis remov from mileston consid ping the author should not block releas high mutex content in metric sum status assign to david activ be fix observ packag status multipl pr open and be rework releas impact not critic for upcom releas if they block move them out activ some pr show movement tyler is activ work on one other have limit updat prometheus export optim return time status worth review for those work on observ metric context 